    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: SearchParameter DocumentReference-Full-Text-Search</b></p><a name=\"DocumentReference-Full-Text-Search\"> </a><a name=\"hcDocumentReference-Full-Text-Search\"> </a><h2>FullTextSearch</h2><p>Parameter <code>full-text</code>:<code>string</code></p><div><p>Searches the textual content of the represented document. The search is performed against the content available via DocumentReference.content.attachment.url.</p>\n</div><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td>Resource</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/documentreference.html\">DocumentReference</a></td></tr><tr><td>Expression</td><td>(none)</td></tr><tr><td>Multiples</td><td><ul><li>multipleAnd: The parameter may only appear once</li><li>multipleOr: The parameter may only have one value (no comma separators)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Modifiers</td><td>Allowed: exact</td></tr></table></div>"
